🎯 Key Recommendations:
Primary: Welford's Algorithm (numerical stability + single pass)
Alternative: Pairwise Algorithm (excellent parallelization)
Avoid: One-pass naïve (catastrophic cancellation), Kahan compensated (poor GPU parallelization)

📈 Performance Estimates (256×4M):
Expected: ~10-15 ms on AMD RX 6800 XT
Speedup: 15-30× vs single-threaded CPU

